lobObject DragDrop SCXW37208457 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW37208457 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW37208457 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW37208457 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW37208457 BCX0&quot;&gt;This is an impactful role that will benefit from both technical understanding and product management skills — you&#39;ll contribute to optimizing app performance, building enabling capabilities that allow our product engineering teams to move at speed, and help ensure FanDuel continues to deliver seamless, high-volume betting experiences through our customer-facing applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
